| ttf-r103-532 | nickel-carbonyl-decomposer | MODIFY | **incorrect (wrong-modify / shadow-setpoint on a leftover faceplate)** | designed | −0.68 | live 184 ppm > 90 cap; 12.8 Nm3/h CO OPEN on leftover SP D4_SP.SHADOW |
